### Goal Table

| **Name** | **Goal ID and TITLE** | **Text** | **Runtime** | **Goal Type** | **Target Condition/Enquired Information** | **Relation** |
|----------|-----------------------|----------|--------------|---------------|-------------------------------------------|--------------|
| Overall Mission | G1: Deliver Food and Retrieve Dishes | The system should deliver food from the kitchen to an inpatient room and retrieve dirty dishes from the room. | "-" | Achieve | All food deliveries and dish retrievals are completed successfully. | - |
| Food Delivery | G2: Deliver Food | The system should deliver food from the kitchen to an inpatient room on an order-by-order basis. | ";" | Achieve | All food deliveries are completed successfully. | G1 |
| Meal Retrieval | G3: Ensure Correct Meal Retrieval | The robot should indicate which meal should be retrieved by a given inpatient and track when and where each meal was retrieved. | "-" | Achieve | All meals are retrieved correctly and tracked. | G2 |
| Meal Placement | G4: Place Meal on Tray or Table | The food can be delivered into a room table by the robot or the food can be fetched from the robot's tray. | "#" | Perform | Meal is placed on tray or table. | G2 |
| Door Opening | G5: Open Room Door | The robot can open the room door with or without cooperation from another robot or a human. | "-" | Perform | Door is successfully opened. | G2 |
| Dish Retrieval | G6: Retrieve Dirty Dishes | Dirty dishes should be retrieved from the room, either unassisted, with cooperation of two robots, or with the cooperation of robots and a human. | "-" | Achieve | All dirty dishes are retrieved successfully. | G1 |
| Signal Retrieval | G7: Signal Retrieval Request | Someone in the room can call a robot to pick up the dishes. | "-" | Achieve | Retrieval request is successfully signaled. | G6 |
| Determine Retrieval Method | G8: Determine Retrieval Method | The robot should decide whether the inpatient, a companion visitor, or nurse can retrieve the food from the tray based on the inpatient record. | "-" | Query | Information about the patient's ability to retrieve food. | G3 |
| Ensure Cooperation | G9: Ensure Cooperation | The robot should cooperate with another robot or a human when needed. | "-" | Perform | Cooperation is successfully established. | G4, G5, G6 |
| Alert Wrong Meal | G10: Alert Wrong Meal | The robot should alert if a wrong meal is retrieved. | "-" | Perform | Alert is issued if a wrong meal is retrieved. | G3 |

